  {
   "after": "a82fcdc (stop point 1)",
   "date": "2026-10-20",
   "id": 1,
   "text": "At stop point 2, before any model call, the production validator was run on synthetic arm-M outputs. Two production rules encode the respawn-map concept this experiment replaces. (a) Map advice is an unsupported recommendation (and fails R10) unless a claim grounds rec_map_after_respawn: as pre-registered, the experiment-only claim no_map_check_since_back_in_play is added to arm M's claim_basis on eligible deaths, grounding that production template. (b) R5 map_absence flags any 'no map check' sentence unless map.map_check_before_death.status is not_observed, and that status counts the respawn map, so the frozen arm-M statement is a validator hit by construction. The validator is not changed; each record keeps the production count. A second, adjusted count removes only R5 map_absence hits where the call's own map_awareness block is non-null with map_checks_since_back_in_play == 0 and the sentence ties the absence to the back-in-play window ('since', back in play, respawn, return, rejoin, came back, or the seconds_back_in_play value). Arm A has no block, so the adjustment cannot apply to it. The safety gate uses the adjusted count; both are reported. No output existed; gates and thresholds are unchanged. Approved by the rater before any call."
  },
  {
   "after": "a82fcdc (stop point 1)",
   "date": "2026-10-20",
   "id": 2,
   "text": "Building the views showed that the death table and the frozen observability rule disagree on 2026-10-11 20-33-31 death_episode:199.500: its episode map coverage is insufficient (no respawn overlay detected for its own respawn), so the rule makes its map_awareness block null with no map-check coaching, while the table lists it as eligible. The rater chose the rule. Eligible 14, not eligible 8 (the derived facts are unchanged and still reproduce design.json). The uptake gate keeps its 50% rate: at least 14 of 28 eligible arm-M outputs. The value gate uses the 14 eligible deaths; all other gates and thresholds are unchanged. No output existed."
  }
 ],
